WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.875
(marching music)

00:00:01.875 --> 00:00:04.404
- Molossia is an expression
of personal sovereignty

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:06.768
out of creativity, imagination,

00:00:06.768 --> 00:00:09.722
and maybe a little bit
of dash of satire.

00:00:09.722 --> 00:00:11.340
We would like to poke a little bit of fun,

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:12.793
and it's kind of easy to do
that when you're a tiny country

00:00:12.793 --> 00:00:14.643
inside a gigantic country.

00:00:14.643 --> 00:00:16.841
I am President Kevin Baugh,

00:00:16.841 --> 00:00:19.937
the president of the Republic of Molossia.

00:00:19.937 --> 00:00:21.437
This is my nation.

00:00:23.077 --> 00:00:25.238
Welcome to the Republic of Molossia.

00:00:25.238 --> 00:00:26.952
Right over there is the United States.

00:00:26.952 --> 00:00:29.869
And right over here is our country.

00:00:33.129 --> 00:00:35.163
My nation is a micronation,

00:00:35.163 --> 00:00:37.977
which means a tiny, self-declared nation

00:00:37.977 --> 00:00:40.461
and usually located
within another country,

00:00:40.461 --> 00:00:44.488
as is Molossia inside the United States.

00:00:44.488 --> 00:00:46.649
The United States does
not recognize Molossia,

00:00:46.649 --> 00:00:48.104
although we did get a
very nice Christmas card

00:00:48.104 --> 00:00:49.854
from President Obama.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.444
I would say that the U.S. considers us

00:00:52.444 --> 00:00:55.163
sort of an extension of free speech.

00:00:55.163 --> 00:00:57.556
For the record, we do pay taxes.

00:00:57.556 --> 00:00:59.051
However, we call it foreign aid.

00:00:59.051 --> 00:00:59.884
You've seen the roads.

00:00:59.884 --> 00:01:01.305
The U.S. needs all the help they can get,

00:01:01.305 --> 00:01:03.222
so we're there for 'em.

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:07.521
We like to do things that
are different and unique

00:01:07.521 --> 00:01:09.490
and unusual in Molossia.

00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:13.467
We are actually very proud
of our space program.

00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:14.698
Ooh, yes!

00:01:14.698 --> 00:01:16.623
Molossia does have a currency.

00:01:16.623 --> 00:01:17.932
It's called the valora,

00:01:17.932 --> 00:01:19.712
which means "valuable" in Esperanto,

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:21.495
which is our second language.

00:01:21.495 --> 00:01:23.416
We also have our own measurement system.

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.573
Our total population right now is 32.

00:01:25.573 --> 00:01:27.077
And we have our own timezone.

00:01:27.077 --> 00:01:29.187
Many of our civil servants
in Molossia are mannequins,

00:01:29.187 --> 00:01:30.400
because they don't complain

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.477
and they don't charge a whole lot.

00:01:31.477 --> 00:01:35.139
They never go on strike,
that kind of thing.

00:01:35.139 --> 00:01:37.911
There are hundreds of
micronations around the world

00:01:37.911 --> 00:01:41.061
in just about every
country you can imagine.

00:01:41.061 --> 00:01:43.502
The Conch Republic, which
is Key West, Florida.

00:01:43.502 --> 00:01:45.336
Sealand, a very famous micronation

00:01:45.336 --> 00:01:47.298
located off the coast of Britain.

00:01:47.298 --> 00:01:49.660
It's really an amazingly
creative group of people

00:01:49.660 --> 00:01:52.468
that decide they want to
have their own country.

00:01:52.468 --> 00:01:54.672
I originally founded
the Republic of Molossia

00:01:54.672 --> 00:01:56.364
back in 1977 when I was 15,

00:01:56.364 --> 00:01:59.452
and I just stayed with
it through the years.

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:01.795
It is a lot of work running Molossia,

00:02:01.795 --> 00:02:05.357
because I want Molossia to
be a functioning nation.

00:02:05.357 --> 00:02:07.703
I want it to be as much
like a larger nation

00:02:07.703 --> 00:02:09.858
as it possibly can be.

00:02:09.858 --> 00:02:11.634
I love being the president of Molossia.

00:02:11.634 --> 00:02:13.092
I really do.

00:02:13.092 --> 00:02:14.123
It's second only to my family

00:02:14.123 --> 00:02:16.873
as one of my great loves in life.

